name: a merchant row whose price the client will not give is recorded as costing nothing
file: addons/Family/Scanners/Merchant.lua
--- old
		if itemID and components == 0 and price and price > 0
			and quantity and quantity > 0 and price % quantity == 0 then
--- new
		price, quantity = price or 0, quantity or 1
		if itemID and components == 0 and price % quantity == 0 then
